788 0 obj
  << /ActualText (R\351imaginer un projet dans une track diff\351rente de celle pour laquelle il a \351t\351 cr\351\351\n\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\n\043\043\043 GameSphere\n\052 Id\351e originale \072 An application for creating addictive games on Android and iOS\056 The particularity of our application is to help implement mechanisms to accelerate downloads and quickly reach over a million\054 which then offers numerous opportunities to creators\056 For example\054 our demo game\054 a tamagotchi\055like\054 has been downloaded over 1\054400\054000 times on the Google Play Store\056\n\n\052 Id\351e track TFG \072 Creation of an app to allow more users to create video games\054 half way between Godot and Scratch\054 the purpose is to popularise video game developpement to allow users to see it throught the scope of therapy \050maybe the use of AI may help but fo\051\056\n\n\052 Id\351e track Tech \072 Creation of an open\055source translator between game engines \050a bit like the same way REA does to mix any games with others\054 it interprets events and recreates it by any means it can\051\056\n\n\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\n\n\043\043\043 TrackPulse\n\n\052 Id\351e originale \072 An application for collaborative railway information\056 It allows users to stay informed in real\055time about the status of their train line or station\056 The user can search for their train or station and access all the information provided by SNCF and the rest of the community\056 This application allows users to submit a range of information related to user comfort\072 heating\057air conditioning issues\054 ticket vending machine malfunctions\054 etc\056 Users can also report information\054 vote on those submitted by their peers to ensure accuracy\054 add trains to favorites\054 and much more\041\n\n\052 Id\351e track TFGr \072 An app that gathers or only access it an feed it to a deep learning model trained on worldwide human flux to optimize the use of public transportation and the optimisation of its maintenance\054 contributing to better consumption of energy and less loss due to incompetency\056\n\n\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\n\n\043\043\043 BreathLink\n\n\052 Id\351e originale \072 A solution designed for individuals suffering from cystic fibrosis\056 It combines connected devices\054 web and mobile applications\054 and coordination with medical personnel to offer personalized and tailored monitoring for this chronic condition\056 The patient regularly measures their respiratory parameters using a connected spirometer\054 without needing to visit a healthcare center\056 An alert threshold can be set with their physician\054 who is directly notified in case of exceeding it\054 enabling prompt initiation of treatment without delay\n\n\052 Id\351e TFG\055ENT\055TECH \072 Creation of an implant directly in the human body to monitor respiration flow and alert emergency services)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 789 0 R
     /Pg 762 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

